      "lines": [
        "22. 符号$\\le$和$\\ge$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "除了符号$<$和$>$外，还采用符号$\\le$（小于或等于）和$\\ge$（大",
        "于或等于）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "不等式$x<6$的自然数解的集合由1，2，3，4，5组成。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果在上列不等式中把符号$<$换成$\\le$，就得到另一个不等",
        "式：$x\\le6$。它的自然数解的集合由1，2，3，4，5，6组成。6是",
        "不等式$x\\le6$的解，但是它不是不等式$x<6$的解。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "315",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在1，4，10，15中，哪些数是下列不等式的解？",
        "а) $x\\le4$；　　　　б) $y\\ge10$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "316",
